keiko 1
# R1 (seen skip lane) — replaces the human walk's "advance to S2, return to the title,
# New Game, Tab at S1" sequence. The return-to-title and New Game halves need the
# overlay's Exit to title, which has no keyboard route and no Keiko control id, so a
# fresh session is reached with a seeded read log instead: S1/S2 read, visited entry.
# Excluded: rendered text, audio, physical input.
fixture read-log fixtures/read-s1-s2.ron
setting play.text_speed 0

new-game
expect surface play
expect scene smoke_entry
expect line "S1 opening"
expect read smoke_entry:4
expect unread smoke_entry:5
skip
expect skip seen
wait 1s
expect surface play
expect line "S3 third"
expect skip off
